"}\n"

msgid "输出结果"
msgstr "Output Result"

msgid "不同版本的costmodel参数可能会使具体数值略有不同，但输出结构类似："
msgstr "Different versions of the costmodel parameters may cause the specific values to differ slightly, but the output structure is similar:"

msgid ""
"block256: 0.098 us\n"
"block1024: 0.110 us\n"
"block2048: 0.126 us\n"
msgstr ""
"block256: 0.098 us\n"
"block1024: 0.110 us\n"
"block2048: 0.126 us\n"

msgid "`costmodel_bench` 每次评估一个item，返回 `(config, latency_us)`。上层autotune逻辑可以逐个调用并汇总成字典，再按预测耗时排序，优先保留预测更快的config。"
msgstr "`costmodel_bench` evaluates one item at a time and returns `(config, latency_us)`. The upper-layer autotune logic can call it one by one and aggregate the results into a dictionary. Then it sorts by predicted latency and prioritizes the configs with faster predicted times."

msgid "关键点说明"
msgstr "Key Points Description"

msgid "`ASTSource + ast_to_ttir` 只生成TTIR，不会真实编译或启动Kernel。"
msgstr "`ASTSource + ast_to_ttir` only generates TTIR, and does not actually compile or launch the kernel."

msgid "`config` 会影响 `tl.constexpr`，例如 `BLOCK_SIZE`，因此每个候选config都需要生成各自的TTIR。"
msgstr "`config` affects `tl.constexpr`, such as `BLOCK_SIZE`; therefore, each candidate config must generate its own TTIR."

msgid "`costmodel_bench` 每次只接收一个item。该item至少包含 `config` 和 `ttir`，也可以附带 `arg_bindings`。"
msgstr "`costmodel_bench` receives only one item at a time. This item must contain at least `config` and `ttir`, and can also include `arg_bindings`."

msgid "`arg_bindings` 用于把运行时整数参数绑定到TTIR中的 `%argN`。例如本例中 `n_elements=98432` 对应 `arg3=98432`。"
msgstr "`arg_bindings` binds runtime integer parameters to `%argN` in TTIR. For example, in this case, `n_elements=98432` corresponds to `arg3=98432`."

msgid "如果Kernel中使用 `tl.program_id(0)`，通常需要传入 `pid_x=0`。如果还使用 `tl.num_programs(0)`，可额外传入 `num_programs_x=...`。"
msgstr "If you use `tl.program_id(0)` in the kernel, you typically need to pass in `pid_x=0`. If you also use `tl.num_programs(0)`, you can additionally pass in `num_programs_x=...`."
